   349	
   350	```text
   351	Six confirmations include the block that contains the receipt anchor.
   352	The sixth block has the selected block number plus five.
   353	The following checks must all pass:
   354	- The selected proof must give at least six confirmations.
   355	- T must be at least the issue time minus 24 hours.
   356	- T must be at most the issue time plus 72 hours.
   357	- The sixth block's time must be at most the issue time plus 72 hours.
