   516	The build test must include a negative control.
   517	The control uses a receipt with these properties:
   518	- All V1 checks can run and pass.
   519	- Only status capture is missing.
   520	A companion verifier must fail the test under either condition:
   521	- It gives INVALID only because status capture is missing.
   522	- It gives CANNOT VERIFY only because status capture is missing.
