   129	and C are both observable, a violated antecedent is a detectable
   130	operating-envelope event, not a silently failed assumption. Timeliness
   131	is **latched at eligibility**: an attempt eligible within the envelope
   132	cannot be expired by later packaging or scheduling delay —
   133	eligible/finalizing, shipped, and expired/refused are mutually
