P5c counts blocks after inclusion and disables `Reorg` at `depth = DepthK`, so an anchor with exactly six confirmations cannot be orphaned in that model. A10’s boundary correction matches that guard, but labelling the newly excluded case `CORRECT` conflicts with the requirement to label claim reductions `NARROW-CLAIM`. I’m also checking whether A10.5 preserves the profile’s selection rules.
