   249	
   250	- Revision 2 applies findings F01 to F23 and O01 to O05 of the review, with the review's proposed text.
   251	- The replay bullet describes another presentation of a receipt. The reattribution bullet describes a false claim
   252	  about its keys or service.
   253	- Each marker shows a place where Amendment 9 is unclear. This text does not resolve it.
