+## F04 — MEDIUM: the clock correction omits registered uses of the same unsupported bound
+
+**Location:** A10.1 and A10.7, especially :64, :184–187, :199–204. Omitted source: A9 at `2ad3489`:177, :186, :294–295, :433–439.
